* SCHD1 -- DPR show schedule screen
MAP DPRSC1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER    AT 0,2   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD USERID    AT 1,70  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD SHOWID    AT 4,20  LEN 8  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD SHOWNAME  AT 5,20  LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD SHOWDAY   AT 6,20  LEN 3  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD SHOWTIME  AT 6,26  LEN 8  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD SHOWSTAT  AT 6,36  LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD MESSAGE   AT 9,5   LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER    AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
